<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header-master') %>
<main class="entity-page">
  <section class="entity-toolbar app-container">
    <div class="entity-title"><span>Master Data</span><b>/</b><strong>Excel Import Staging</strong></div>
    <button id="excel-import-refresh" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Refresh Batch</button>
    <button id="forecast-template-download" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Unduh Template Forecast</button>
    <button data-legacy-template="customer" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Template Customer</button>
    <button data-legacy-template="product" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Template Produk FG</button>
  </section>
  <div id="excel-import-alert" class="alert d-none mx-4 mt-3"></div>
  <section class="app-container py-3">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4"><div class="card-body p-4">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-2 mb-3"><div><h5 class="mb-1">Import Data Excel / CSV</h5><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Pilih jenis data, unggah file atau paste JSON, lalu periksa hasil preview sebelum menyimpan dan menerapkan batch.</p></div><span class="badge text-bg-light align-self-start">Preview &amp; approval wajib</span></div>
      <div class="row g-3 mb-3"><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Jenis import</label><select id="excel-import-type" class="form-select"><option value="FORECAST">Forecast FG</option><option value="SALES_HISTORY">Historis Sales Actual</option><option value="MATERIAL_DEMAND_HISTORY">Historis Demand Material</option><option value="CUSTOMER_MASTER">Master Customer dari Excel/CSV</option><option value="PRODUCT_MASTER">Master Produk FG dari Excel/CSV</option></select></div></div>
      <div class="alert alert-info">Migrasi master: unduh template, isi Operation CREATE/UPDATE dan kode stabil, lalu upload dan periksa selisih. Impor Customer sebelum Produk FG. Kolom kosong mempertahankan nilai lama; penghapusan, perubahan UOM dan penggantian customer produk dilakukan melalui master data. Maksimal 500 baris per batch. Template XLSX dapat disimpan sebagai CSV UTF-8.</div>
      <div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label">Nama file sumber</label><input id="excel-import-file-name" class="form-control" value="forecast.xlsx" maxlength="255"></div><div class="col-md-3"><label class="form-label">Tipe file</label><select id="excel-import-file-type" class="form-select"><option value="xlsx">.xlsx</option><option value="xls">.xls</option><option value="csv">.csv</option></select></div><div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Periode sumber</label><input id="excel-import-period" class="form-control" placeholder="Contoh: Aug-Sep 2026"></div></div>
      <div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">Upload workbook</label><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><input id="excel-import-file" class="form-control" type="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" style="max-width:420px"><button id="excel-import-upload" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Baca File &amp; Preview</button></div><div class="form-text">Mendukung .xlsx, .xls (BIFF), dan .csv hingga 20 MB. Sheet, nomor baris, dan formula sumber disimpan sebagai provenance; file tidak langsung membuat transaksi.</div></div>
      <div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">Sheet yang diproses</label><select id="excel-import-sheets" class="form-select" multiple size="4" disabled></select><div class="form-text">Pilih hanya sheet sesuai jenis import. Baris yang tidak dapat dipetakan tetap ditahan sebagai error dan tidak membentuk transaksi.</div></div>
      <div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">Rows JSON</label><textarea id="excel-import-rows" class="form-control font-monospace" rows="10" spellcheck="false">[
  {"sheetName":"Forecast","rowNumber":2,"sourceJson":{"Customer":"C004","Part Code":"FG-001","Agustus 2026":10000,"September 2026":12000,"UOM":"pcs"}}
]</textarea><div class="form-text">Kolom bulan diproses per bulan; duplikasi customer–part–bulan dijumlahkan. Part WIP/RAW akan ditolak.</div></div>
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3"><button id="excel-import-preview" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Preview JSON Manual</button><button id="excel-import-save" class="btn btn-primary brand-button" type="button" disabled>Simpan ke Staging</button><button id="excel-import-approve" class="btn btn-outline-success" type="button" disabled>Setujui Batch</button><button id="excel-import-apply" class="btn btn-success" type="button" disabled>Terapkan Data</button></div>
      <div id="excel-import-preview-result" class="mt-4 d-none"></div>
      <button id="legacy-report-download" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mt-3 d-none" type="button">Unduh Laporan Rekonsiliasi JSON</button>
    </div></div>
    <section class="table-shell entity-table-shell"><div class="p-3 border-bottom"><h5 class="mb-0">Riwayat Batch</h5></div><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Batch</th><th>File</th><th>Periode</th><th>Rows</th><th>Error</th><th>Status</th><th>Dibuat</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody id="excel-import-batches"><tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted py-4">Memuat batch…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
